pipelines: auto-push and PR creation

Add push/pr flags to auto-push commits and open PRs when pipelines finish.
Configure globally in config.yaml or per-pipeline. Use -b to create and
track branches before running. PR creation uses gh CLI with --fill --draft.

Also adds context field to config for files included in all tasks, removes
backwards compat for old pipeline list format (now requires tasks: key),
and makes lf land push after merge.
